      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:NUM.28.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And on the seventh day ye shall have an holy convocation; ye shall do no servile work.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.28.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:NUM.28.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "¶ Also in the day of the firstfruits, when ye bring a new meat offering unto the LORD, after your weeks ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be out",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
